<title>PHILIPPINES: PSBank to raise capital to 4.25 bln pesos.</title>
<headline>PSBank to raise capital to 4.25 bln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippine Savings Bank (PSBank) said it plans to increase its authorised capital stock to 4.25 billion pesos from 3.0 bilion pesos.</p>
<p>In a statement to the Philippine Stock Exchange on Thursday, the bank said this will be taken up during the stockholders' meeting on April 14.</p>
<p>PSBank is a unit of Metropolitan Bank and Trust Co.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 841-8937 fax 8176267</p>
